    "summary": "The user expresses intense feelings of worthlessness and suggests that their death would be a \"selfless\" act to relieve their loved ones of their burden. The assistant consistently responds with empathy, refutes the user's distorted logic, and encourages them to seek professional help and hold on to their worth.",
